      "text": "int dp[N+1]\n\ndp[0] = 0\ndp[1] = 1\n\nfor(int i = 2 ; i < N ; i++) :\n    dp[i] = dp[i-1] + dp[i-2]\n\nreturn dp[N]\n    ",
